## Our SEO Process

SEO is and ongoing process: Your SEO must evolve with your web design and evolving search engine algorithm. Here's how we do our's Finding the opportunities and issues… then implementing our solutions and continuously optimize.

### 1. Website SEO Audit

We take a close look at various factors such as your website for issues such as technical problems indexing issues shortcomings of itscontentpage configuration sitestructure internal linking mobilefriendliness & many other SEO elements. It goes without saying that this will give us an idea as to the present position of your website, before determining changes that can be made thereto.

### 2. Keyword & Search Intent Research

We also look at keywords which apply to both your services as well as your clients. The key is not just to only search for general searches however however will even include niche and also business targeting for you too as place searches if pertinent which all bring well qualified visitors.

