### 3. Competitor Research

What Your Competitor Knows That You Don’t As part of our analysis, we study our competitor’s content, websites structure, keywords targets, in other words, their local ranking signals – how can your web presence go to work to dominate there.

### 4. On-Page SEO

We optimize the pages that matter most for your business.

This can include:

- SEO titles
- Meta descriptions
- H1, H2 and H3 structure
- Page content
- URLs
- Internal links
- Image optimization
- Keyword placement
- Search intent alignment
- Relevant structured data

The objective is to make every important page clear to both users and search engines.

### 5. Technical SEO

Technical SEO services in Ballabgarh address the issues that can have a bearing on a website's crawling, indexing, and user interaction.

Depending on your website, this may include:

- Crawlability issues
- Indexation problems
- XML sitemap
- Robots.txt
- Canonicalization
- Broken links
- Redirects
- Duplicate content
- Mobile usability
- Page speed
- Core Web Vitals
- Website architecture
- Structured data

### 6. Content Optimization

Content should answer the search, not repeat the keyword. We help you improve on-page pages and uncover content gaps to make sure your site is covering key topics, answering customer questions, establishing authority, and attracting more qualified searches.

### 7. Off-Page SEO & Authority Building

For any given keyword, there will be several results, and a website’s authority plays a role in its potential to win against competitors. We use the off-site elements of the digital promotion effort by earned relevant signals from high-quality link building and digital outreach activities in spite of having poor quality backlinks.

### 8. Performance Monitoring

We continuously work with the SEO data – we track keyword popularity and landing page performance and adapt our strategy as required. From this information, we spot potential opportunities, areas where improvement is needed, and decide on priorities.

